# Byte-identical in the repo and on disk: Factorio and the zip do not care about line
# endings, so a silent CRLF rewrite makes `git diff` report 4000 changed lines when 150
# are real, which is how a bulk edit went unreviewed. eol=lf is set explicitly rather than
# left to core.autocrlf because that switch is machine-global and a second clone changes it.
* text eol=lf
